{"track":"r","category":"tidyr·stringr·lubridate","level":2,"title":"replace_na로 결측 채우기","packages":["dplyr","tidyr"],"datasets":["movies"],"desc":"<p>평점이 <code>NA</code>인 영화의 평점을 <b>0</b>으로 채우고, <code>title</code>, <code>rating</code>을 <code>result</code>에 담으세요.</p>","ordered":false,"starter":"# 데이터프레임이 이미 준비되어 있어요. 정답을 result 변수에 담아 주세요.\nlibrary(dplyr)\nlibrary(tidyr)\n\nresult <- NULL\n","solution":"library(dplyr)\nlibrary(tidyr)\n\nresult <- movies |>\n  mutate(rating = replace_na(rating, 0)) |>\n  select(title, rating)","hint":"<p><code>replace_na(열, 대체값)</code></p>","id":"r-407","expected":{"columns":["title","rating"],"rows":[["Midnight Train",8.1],["Space Harvest",7.4],["The Last Garden",8.6],["Laugh Track",6.2],["Quantum Drift",7.9],["Paper Moon City",8.3],["Iron Harbor",6.8],["Silent Orchard",7.2],["Double Booked",7],["Edge of Dawn",7.6],["Little Comets",8],["Hollow Signal",0],["Sunday Brunch",5.9],["Steel Rain",7.1]]}}